{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：05:50 2026-09-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：05:50 2026-09-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：05:50 2026-09-03 HKT</p><p>拍賣場「筍盤」備受市場追捧，忠誠拍賣昨連環售出4個物業。其中，位於九龍塘新德園新德園一伙單號洋房，面積約2,354方呎，單位屬法院令物業，開拍價3,600萬元，最終獲一枱客「一口價」拍出，呎價15,293元。</p><img alt=\"新德園單號洋房，面積約2,354方呎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2d1ba5ad6b9a6d29620bf0cd0a0dca1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大廳空間寬敞，裝修雅緻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b14d5659d5a771c431e148c5183e679b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_20.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8de95dd358f3415350adfb5af5279a3b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba905c433bd6a775382455e93143b492/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0f9f1d4893eb2391f2475a3713aac75/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_20_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c573df477380e23398ceb63992f840a1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_21.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f9f183682e22dbbfba755097bf8a8c7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_20_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5584e68a3b597daeb4241a60b1759f6a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-03_at_10_51_21_1_.jpeg\"/><p>根據市場成交顯示，屋苑於7月新錄一宗雙號洋房二手個案，成交價5,000萬元，呎價約24,284元，是次拍賣價錢較市場低28%。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T03:43:59.242832+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}